{
"#name"
:
{
"ghclaw"
:
null
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
null
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"GitHub event watcher — poll the events timeline (repo / org / user), dedup by cursor, dispatch to the built-in AI agents"
,
"cn"
:
"GitHub 事件监视器 — 轮询 events 时间线（单仓/组织/个人），游标去重，派发给内置 AI 智能体"
}
,
"#keyword"
:
[
"github events"
,
"github watcher"
,
"仓库监听"
]
,
"#subcmd_help_tip"
:
true
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw run --repo x-cmd/x-cmd"
,
"cn"
:
"前台监听 x-cmd/x-cmd 仓库并自动分类/回复新 issue"
,
"en"
:
"Watch x-cmd/x-cmd in the foreground and auto-triage/reply"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw listen --repo x-cmd/x-cmd"
,
"cn"
:
"后台监听 x-cmd/x-cmd 仓库的 events 事件"
,
"en"
:
"Watch x-cmd/x-cmd repo events in the background"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw listen --org x-bash"
,
"cn"
:
"后台监听 x-bash 组织下所有仓库的公共事件"
,
"en"
:
"Watch public events across all repos in the x-bash org"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw ls"
,
"cn"
:
"列出所有活跃监听及其状态"
,
"en"
:
"List all active listeners and their state"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw consume --repo x-cmd/x-cmd"
,
"cn"
:
"消费 x-cmd/x-cmd 的 MQ：新 issue 自动分类打标签、@x 自动回复（Ctrl-C 退出）"
,
"en"
:
"Consume the x-cmd/x-cmd MQ — auto-triage/label + @x auto-reply (Ctrl-C to exit)"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:quick start"
:
[
"run"
]
,
"#subcmd:watch"
:
[
"listen"
,
"consume"
]
,
"#subcmd:manage"
:
[
"ls"
,
"stop"
]
,
"run"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"All-in-one foreground runtime — start the listener AND consume events in one shot (AI triage + labeling for new issues, @x keyword auto-reply); everything tears down on exit"
,
"cn"
:
"一站式前台运行 — 一次跑起监听 + 消费（新 issue AI 分类打标签、@x 关键词自动回复）；退出时全部停止"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- Equivalent to: x ghclaw listen ...  followed by  x ghclaw consume ...\n- On exit the listen worker is torn down — for long-running watching use 'x ghclaw listen' instead\n- Target kind is required: --repo owner/repo | --org <org> | --user <name>\n- --org covers the whole organization but PUBLIC events only; private repos stay per-repo\n- --user is a person-centric activity stream (what the user did), not a repo stream\n- --interval accepts human time, e.g. 30s, 1min, 2h30m ; default 60\n- Auth: GH_TOKEN (or GITHUB_TOKEN) is required\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- 等价于先跑 x ghclaw listen ... 再跑 x ghclaw consume ...\n- 退出时会连带停掉 listen worker — 要长期监听请改用 x ghclaw listen\n- 监听类型必填：--repo owner/repo | --org <组织> | --user <用户名>\n- --org 覆盖整个组织，但仅公共事件；私有仓仍走单仓监听\n- --user 是「以人为中心」的个人动态流（此人做了什么），不是仓库动态\n- --interval 支持人性化时间，如 30s、1min、2h30m；默认 60\n- 认证：必填环境变量 GH_TOKEN（或 GITHUB_TOKEN）\n"
}
]
,
"--repo"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Watch a single repo (public or private, token permitting)"
,
"cn"
:
"监听单个仓库（token 可读即可，公私皆可）"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"GitHub repo in <owner>/<repo> form"
,
