:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw run --repo x-cmd/x-cmd --interval 1min"
,
"cn"
:
"前台监听 x-cmd/x-cmd 并自动分类/回复新 issue，轮询间隔 1 分钟"
,
"en"
:
"Watch x-cmd/x-cmd in the foreground and auto-triage/reply, 1-minute interval"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw run --org x-bash"
,
"cn"
:
"前台监听 x-bash 组织公共事件并自动分类/回复新 issue"
,
"en"
:
"Watch x-bash org public events in the foreground and auto-triage/reply"
}
]
}
,
"listen"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Start a background listener — poll the events timeline and append events to the target's MQ file; manage with 'x ghclaw ls' / 'x ghclaw stop'"
,
"cn"
:
"启动后台监听 — 轮询 events 时间线并把事件追加到该目标的 MQ 文件；用 x ghclaw ls / x ghclaw stop 管理"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- Runs as a background worker; one listener per target — restarting clears that target's poll state\n- The MQ is an append-only file; consume it with 'x ghclaw consume' or any external tool (python, awk, ...) keeping its own cursor\n- Cursor dedup by event id; one JSON file per event; idle polls are 304 and cost nothing against the GitHub rate limit\n- The target is normalized to lowercase: 'Octocat' and 'octocat' are the same listener\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- 以后台 worker 运行；每个 target 一个监听 — 重启监听会清空该 target 的轮询状态\n- MQ 是只追加文件；可用 x ghclaw consume 或任意外部工具（python、awk 等）自带游标消费\n- 事件 id 游标去重；每事件一个 JSON 文件；空闲轮询为 304，不消耗 GitHub 速率限制\n- target 会规范为小写：'Octocat' 与 'octocat' 是同一个监听\n"
}
]
,
