{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw listen --user octocat --interval 30s"
,
"cn"
:
"后台监听 octocat 用户的动态，轮询间隔 30 秒"
,
"en"
:
"Start a background listener on user octocat with a 30-second interval"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw listen --org x-bash"
,
"cn"
:
"后台监听 x-bash 组织下所有仓库的公共事件"
,
"en"
:
"Start a background listener for public events across the x-bash org"
}
]
}
,
"consume"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Consume the target's MQ and dispatch each event to the built-in agents — AI triage + labels for new issues, auto-reply on the @x keyword (blocks; Ctrl-C to exit)"
,
"cn"
:
"消费该目标的 MQ 并把事件派发给内置智能体 — 新 issue AI 分类打标签、@x 关键词自动回复（前台阻塞；Ctrl-C 退出）"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- Default handlers: AI triage on new issues (skips already-labeled ones; labels are picked from the repo's existing vocabulary, never auto-created) + auto-reply when the body contains the @x keyword (configurable via GHCLAW_REPLY_KEYWORD)\n- Decoupled from listen: 'x ghclaw listen' keeps writing even while nothing consumes\n- Any external tool can read the same MQ file with its own cursor instead of this built-in consumer\n- The whole dispatch callback can be replaced by defining ___X_CMD_GHCLAW_TAILER_HANDLE before running\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- 默认 handler：新 issue AI 分类（已带标签的跳过；标签只从仓库已有词表里选，绝不自动创建）+ 正文含 @x 关键词时自动回复（关键词可用 GHCLAW_REPLY_KEYWORD 改）\n- 与 listen 解耦：即使没有消费端，x ghclaw listen 也会持续写入\n- 也可以不用内置消费者，让任意外部工具自带游标读同一个 MQ 文件\n- 派发回调整体可被 ___X_CMD_GHCLAW_TAILER_HANDLE 覆盖\n"
}
]
,
"--repo"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Consume the MQ of this repo (kind is accepted for symmetry; only the target locates the MQ)"
,
"cn"
:
"消费该仓库的 MQ（kind 仅为对齐参数；定位 MQ 只需 target）"
}
,
