"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw consume x-cmd/x-cmd"
,
"cn"
:
"消费 x-cmd/x-cmd 的 MQ：新 issue 自动分类打标签、@x 关键词自动回复"
,
"en"
:
"Consume the x-cmd/x-cmd MQ — auto-triage/label new issues, auto-reply on @x"
}
]
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List active listeners (target, pid, start time, state)"
,
"cn"
:
"列出活跃监听（目标、pid、启动时间、状态）"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- Lists listen workers in the ghclaw-default-worker namespace\n- Empty output means no listener is running — start one with 'x ghclaw listen'\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- 列出 ghclaw-default-worker 命名空间下的 listen worker\n- 无输出表示没有监听在运行 — 用 x ghclaw listen 启动一个\n"
}
]
}
,
"stop"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Stop listener(s) — by target, or --all; MQ and state are kept unless --purge"
,
"cn"
:
"停止监听 — 按 target 或 --all；默认保留 MQ 和状态，--purge 才清除"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- 'x ghclaw stop x-cmd/x-cmd' stops only that listener's worker\n- --repo/--org/--user are accepted for symmetry; only the target locates the worker\n- Add --purge to also remove the target's .state and .mq (per-event JSON files are shared and untouched)\n- Without --purge the MQ file stays on disk and can still be read after the listener is gone\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- 'x ghclaw stop x-cmd/x-cmd' 只停该监听的 worker\n- --repo/--org/--user 仅为对齐参数，定位 worker 只需 target\n- 加 --purge 同时清除该 target 的 .state 和 .mq（每事件 JSON 文件为共享数据，不受影响）\n- 不加 --purge 时 MQ 文件保留在磁盘上，监听停止后仍可读取\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw stop --repo x-cmd/x-cmd"
,
"cn"
:
"停止 x-cmd/x-cmd 的监听（保留 MQ）"
,
"en"
:
"Stop the x-cmd/x-cmd listener with the kind flag (keep the MQ)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw stop x-cmd/x-cmd"
,
"cn"
:
"停止 x-cmd/x-cmd 的监听（保留 MQ）"
,
"en"
:
"Stop the x-cmd/x-cmd listener (keep the MQ)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ghclaw stop --all --purge"
,
"cn"
:
"停止全部监听并清除各自的轮询状态和 MQ"
,
"en"
:
"Stop all listeners and purge their poll state and MQ"
}
]
}
